                            "friendlyName": "High-Risk Artificial Intelligence System - 1",
                            "description": "<p>A \"Substantial Factor\" means a factor that (a) assists in making a Consequential Decision; (b) is capable of altering the outcome of a Consequential Decision; and (c) is generated by an Artificial Intelligence System.  Substantial Factor includes any use of an AI System to generate any content, decision, prediction, or recommendation concerning an owner, member, guest, or associate (collectively, \"individual\") that is used as a basis to make a Consequential Decision concerning the individual.</p><p><br></p><p>A \"Consequential Decision\" means a decision that has a material legal or similarly significant effect on the provision or denial to any individual of, or the cost or terms of:</p><p><br></p><ul><li>education enrollment or an education opportunity;</li><li>employment or an employment opportunity;</li><li>a financial or lending service; </li><li>an essential government service;</li><li>health-care services;</li><li>housing;</li><li>insurance; or</li><li>a legal service.</li></ul><p><br></p>",
